  type_array_err_no_of.pcpp - break step of type_array.pcpp:
  'of' comes before the element type (PR0001)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_array_err_no_of.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_array_err_no_of.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
